e who need S.H.I.T. in their life <BR>just not the same person who sent you this S.H.I.T. They have already <BR>had their fill of S.H.I.T. Thank you for your time. <P>Sincerely, <P>The Director Under the Main Bureau of Super High Intensity Training. <BR>(The D.U.M.B. S.H.I.T.). <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>My work of art.(in progress.)    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/carpicsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
